From c5caa1c22dcfa16d457a1c60eebef1f18f659348 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Apr 2026 14:41:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix FILL3D profiles: correct IDs, structure, add PETG CF

- Remove PLA Turbo @base/@System (already merged in main as FILL3D001/FILL3D001SYS;
  duplicate name caused CI validation failure)
- Fix filament_id convention to match main: FILL3D002-FILL3D007 (3-digit)
- Fix setting_id convention: FILL3D002SYS-FILL3D007SYS
- Slim @System files to minimal structure matching main's PLA Turbo @System style
- Move filament_max_volumetric_speed to @base files
- Preserve real FILL3D-tuned settings in all @base files
- Add new FILL3D PETG CF @base/@System (FILL3D007/FILL3D007SYS)
- Update OrcaFilamentLibrary.json with all 12 correct entries

Validated with orca_extra_profile_check.py: 0 errors.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01BcL5XJ3XNnCfm7skRQAP4y
